# RouterOS binary backups contain the WiFi PSK, SSH keys and user hashes.
# Keep them on the router and in your password manager, never in git.
*.backup

# Local configuration. May hold a venue's WiFi password and the path to an
# SSH private key. .env.example is the committed, secret-free template.
.env

# Rendered from k8c-edge.rsc.tmpl by `just apply` - regenerate, do not commit.
k8c-edge.rendered.rsc
bgp-metallb.rendered.rsc
